        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, meet your English-speaking guide for a tour of Cartagena. The city stands on the Caribbean coast, and its historic centre is still surrounded by fortified walls.\n\nVisit the old town to see its churches and monuments, as well as the 17th-century San Felipe de Barajas Fortress. You’ll also stop at La Popa Hill and visit the convent at the top, where you can take in panoramic views of Cartagena and the coast.\n\nCartagena brings together historic architecture, sea views and modern city life. As you walk, you can see where the walled colonial quarter gives way to the modern city along the waterfront. Return to the hotel after the tour and relax."
    },
